Dear PGP Trial Software Customer:=20
=20
Congratulations on taking advantage of our free 30-day trial of PGP(R)
Desktop software=E2=80=94from the industry=E2=80=99s leading encryption sof=
tware
provider.*
=20
I have found that people receive the most value from our Trial
Software when they take these 3 steps in the first few days of
downloading the software:
=20
1) Publish your PGP key to the PGP(R) Global Directory. The PGP Global
Directory is a free service hosted by PGP Corporation that helps
customers, partners, colleagues, and friends automatically find your
PGP key. Please go to
http://r.vresp.com/?PGP/3299cb6c26/919042/f8042d8719/837b8a6
to learn how to publish your PGP key to the PGP Global Directory.

2) Once you have published your PGP key to the PGP(R) Global
Directory, send a test email to pgpdesktoptrial@pgpmail.net. We will
generate an automated, encrypted reply to confirm the successful
installation of your PGP(R) Desktop Email trial software. If you do
not receive an automated response within 1/2 hour, a problem has been
detected. In this case, please go to
http://r.vresp.com/?PGP/534905a534/919042/f8042d8719/837b8a6
to read about sending and receiving email.

3) PGP Desktop Notifier alerts are a feature of PGP Desktop Email that
tell you what is going on with your messaging and give you control
over it. Experienced PGP users will recognize that the Notifier has
replaced the "Encrypt" buttons in previous versions of PGP Desktop
products. When you send an encrypted message, the Notifier alert
appears in the lower right corner of your screen.=20

Please go to
http://r.vresp.com/?PGP/6227eb8f41/919042/f8042d8719/837b8a6
to see the easy-to-follow, step-by-step instructions with screen
shots. Our Quick Start Guide provides easy-to-use, graphical
guidelines. The Quick Start Guide may be found in the:	C:\Program
Files\PGP Corporation\PGP Desktop\Documentation folder (if you used
the default download configuration).

You may also take advantage of the PGP Support Knowledge Base
http://r.vresp.com/?PGP/b89e9493c6/919042/f8042d8719/837b8a6
at any time. As part of your Trial Software purchase, we provide
access to PGP User Forums at
http://r.vresp.com/?PGP/5718870fc2/919042/f8042d8719/837b8a6
where experienced users will often answer any questions you might
have. Although we provide full Call Me Back and email technical
support once you purchase PGP Desktop products, we cannot provide
direct technical support during the trial period to the large number
of Trial Software users.
=20
Regards,
Laura Lee
PGP Customer Service Representative
